{"server":"cn","storyId":"story_doroth_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_doroth_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"何处是我朋友的家","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_doroth_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"f36f2e989ce12fbbbd133a8d632a17fa1a5892d76046837929fe73ec26797438","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g11_monitoringroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"名字？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多萝西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"请回答你的全名。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"我奉劝你最好配合我们的工作，本次对话将全程录音。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"我方会根据目前的调查结果，结合本次问询的内容，推进接下来的处理方案。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"这关系到你的命运，也关系到所有359号基地相关人员的命运。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好的，我明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的名字是，多萝西·弗兰克斯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_outcounty"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提篮少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_004","isRemote":false,"text":"多萝西！多萝西！你快来看啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提篮少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_004","isRemote":false,"text":"前面有好大一片草原呀！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提篮少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_004","isRemote":false,"text":"视野很好，快看看有没有你的家！嗯......银色的小房子......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格罗斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_526_1","isRemote":false,"text":"GO......GO-LOS-E！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提篮少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_004","isRemote":false,"text":"喂！格罗斯！把你的气球拿开一点！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提篮少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_004","isRemote":false,"text":"你挡住我们的视线啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"菜菜，我已经仔仔细细看过了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没有银色的房子......我的家，并不是这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菜菜","speakerId":"avg_npc_004","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......没关系啦，这里也不是我的家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菜菜","speakerId":"avg_npc_004","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然风景很美，但还是不如我家的那片麦田呀！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格罗斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_526_1","isRemote":false,"text":"GO......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？格罗斯......你怎么了？让我往旁边看？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......那里好像有个人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你、你好！这位沃尔珀先生，你看上去好像遇到了什么麻烦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蹲在路边的沃尔珀","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我找不到我的家了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蹲在路边的沃尔珀","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我和哥哥大吵了一架，把房子都吵颠倒过来了。于是我跑了出来，发誓再也不要回去......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蹲在路边的沃尔珀","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我一路跑到了这里......但是外面也太可怕了......我想回家，可是再也回不去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菜菜","speakerId":"avg_npc_004","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么会回不去呢？你是迷路了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你找不到回家的路了，我们可以一起走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蹲在路边的沃尔珀","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，我跟你们走。两位善良的小姐，还有这位......拿着气球的机器人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蹲在路边的沃尔珀","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过我发誓，当你们看到我的家，你们就会理解为什么我说再也回不去了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蹲在路边的沃尔珀","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"顺带一提，我不是什么沃尔珀先生。我可是骄傲的阿斯兰。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g11_monitoringroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调查员","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"你说，你的目的是寻找“家园”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调查员","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"同时，也在帮那些拓荒者寻找“家园”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"正是如此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调查员","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调查员","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"我此行来359号基地，是为了调查事件的原委。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调查员","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"请你不要用这些虚浮的词汇来搪塞我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这并不是搪塞，我确实是这样想的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请容许我再确认一下——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"359号基地的其他实验人员，以及拓荒者们，已经切实被安排妥当了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调查员","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调查员","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"我没有义务回答你的问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调查员","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"你如此关心那些拓荒者的去向，有什么目的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调查员","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"据我所知，你的母亲正是一位拓荒者，对吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调查员","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"你的童年，是一直跟随着她、跟随着拓荒队的，对吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调查员","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"而你的母亲身故于荒野上的一场天灾，对吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这位先生，我并不是很想谈论这个话题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想必你们对我的身世已经非常了解了......不过，这些事情又与你们目前在调查的事，有什么关系呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调查员","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，如果我的表述让你感到不适，我很抱歉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调查员","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"以下是我的猜测——那些受验人员......对你来说或许有着特殊意义。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拓荒者......他们在荒野中游荡，直至他们生命的终点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们像无所依归的风暴，从一方土地迁徙至另一方土地。即便他们也是开拓者，却并无任何一方土地属于他们自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"让他们过上更好的生活，这是我的理想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至于我的亲人们......我会代替他们走下去，回到他们曾经在无数个幻梦中回归的“家园”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g3_cottage"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格罗斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_526_1","isRemote":false,"text":"GO-LOS-E。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"格罗斯......这就是你的家？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格罗斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_526_1","isRemote":false,"text":"GO。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格罗斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_526_1","isRemote":false,"text":"GO......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“阿斯兰”先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它好像想告诉我们什么......你看它的手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“阿斯兰”先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们觉得，它是不是想让我们帮它打开那个抽屉？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菜菜","speakerId":"avg_npc_004","isRemote":false,"text":"抽屉？里面有什么啊......我来看看！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菜菜","speakerId":"avg_npc_004","isRemote":false,"text":"这是......一个录音机？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格罗斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_526_1","isRemote":false,"text":"家......家......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菜菜","speakerId":"avg_npc_004","isRemote":false,"text":"欸！格......格罗斯刚刚是不是说话了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"机器人开始拆解自己的身体。\n它一直紧攥着的气球，飘浮到了天花板上。\n机器人露出了“胸膛”中的核心，将自己的“心”放进了录音机里。\n录音机发出了声响......那是一位老人的声音。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老人的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳......我叫格罗斯，是一位机器人工匠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老人的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我已经走不动了，但我还离家很远。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老人的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我把我的声音留了下来，放进它的身体里。希望它能带着我的声音回家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老人的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"陌生人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老人的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"如果有人听到我的声音......请替我看看，我的家现在是什么样子......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老人的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"走吧，我的机器人，带着我的声音回家吧！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"老人的声音就此停止。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格罗斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_526_1","isRemote":false,"text":"LOSE......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"机器人发出最后的声音，随后也变成冰冷的铁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"格罗斯......即使我知道了这并不是你的名字，但我还是想这样称呼你......你做到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，你所做的一切，并不只是为了代替你的主人回家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里......也是你的家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鲁珀先生。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“阿斯兰”先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么了？我不是什么鲁珀，我是阿斯兰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，阿斯兰先生......你能帮我够到格罗斯的气球吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想带着它的气球，继续走下去......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g4_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调查员","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"让我们言归正传吧。有关与军方的合作，目前看来都是由斐尔迪南出面谈的，而你的实验看似完全合法合规。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调查员","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"我想确认的是，你与斐尔迪南私下里是否联络密切？你真的对他的计划一无所知吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，我确实与斐尔迪南不太熟悉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调查员","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，也的确没有任何证据表明你对此知情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调查员","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"经过影像记录的确认，你对莱茵内部文件的接触权限，与普通研究员没有什么区别。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的时间总是不够用，我总希望自己的实验能更快更好地完成......我实在没有余力去关注其他材料。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调查员","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"就算你这样说，这也是一件非常不可思议的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调查员","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"正常人都不会这样回避情报，何况你是莱茵生命的一名主任。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调查员","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"我们有理由怀疑这些影像记录，正是你准备用来为自己洗清嫌疑的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"准备虚假的影像记录来应付事后调查，显然并不能帮我更快地完成实验，也不能帮到拓荒者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我为什么要这么做？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调查员","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"你不想知道自己在其他人的计划中充当什么样的角色吗？是合作伙伴，还是一枚棋子？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没关系的，调查员先生。我并不在乎自己在别人的计划中是什么位置。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的研究，我的理想......对我自己而言有意义，而对其他人来说，它们或许也能产生非凡的价值。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果这些人想利用这一点，那我也愿意与他们交易。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调查员","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"这么说，你甘愿被当作棋子。难道你不怕被利用，被伤害？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"被伤害......您是指锒铛入狱吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调查员","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"据我所知......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我知道的。就像洛肯·威廉姆斯那样......我见过太多做错了事，又被政府抛弃的科学家的下场。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，我碰巧也知道，像曾经的我一样，去监狱中找洛肯咨询和协助研究的人并不少。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调查员","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调查员","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳。所以你甚至做好了最坏的打算。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一路走来......我正是依靠这些立足的，这就是哥伦比亚的规则。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"否则，一个拓荒者的孩子，是如何能成为莱茵生命的一名主任的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调查员","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调查员","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"我原以为......你从未考虑过这些事情。可......即使你不在乎自己被利用，那拓荒者呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调查员","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"或许在斐尔迪南等人眼中，你再怎么说也是他们的同事。但那些拓荒者，和榨干价值后被弃之荒野的塑料袋有什么区别？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......那么，他们会付出代价的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我现在还做不到，以后我也一定会做到。这是我的责任，也是我以前疏忽的部分。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是我之前犯下的......最大的错。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g2_edgeofbase"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"菲林先生！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"菲林先生？你在那里站着干什么呢，快走呀！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“阿斯兰”先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不是沃尔珀先生，也不是什么菲林先生。我是阿斯兰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“阿斯兰”先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这位小姐，我发誓这是我最后一次纠正你了。再有下一次，我一定要让你看看我那一口锋利的后槽牙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，“阿斯兰”先生。咱们继续走吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“阿斯兰”先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们走吧，我已经找到我的家了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的家？在哪儿呢......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“阿斯兰”先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们抬头。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一座倒置的房子，正悬在多萝西他们的头顶之上，飘浮在辽远的天空中。\n多萝西终于明白，为什么“阿斯兰”先生说再也回不去他的家了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“阿斯兰”先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我犯下了此生无法挽回的错误。只因自己的高傲，我永远离开了自己的家园。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“阿斯兰”先生，总有办法让你回家的。我们可以一起想！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“阿斯兰”先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们走吧，我就留在这。这是我应受的惩罚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"空中......飘在空中......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“阿斯兰”先生！我们还有格罗斯的气球！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“阿斯兰”先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"气球......你是说，让气球把我送上天空？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“阿斯兰”先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我试试......好像还真可以，我的脚已经离地了！得再减轻点重量！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菜菜","speakerId":"avg_npc_004","isRemote":false,"text":"天哪！“阿斯兰”先生，你在做什么......这些都是......水？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菜菜","speakerId":"avg_npc_004","isRemote":false,"text":"这么多水......怎么都从你的耳朵里倒出来了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“阿斯兰”先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿......为了让我显得更强壮，我吸了不少水......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“阿斯兰”先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"脑袋里一直晃晃荡荡的......你们看！我飞起来了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“阿斯兰”先生随着气球缓缓升空——他尖叫着，不知是因为惊恐还是兴奋。\n有一瞬间，多萝西清晰地看见了他的后槽牙——那并不算锋利，甚至有点圆润可爱。\n不知为什么，多萝西流泪了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g1_outdoorbase"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调查员","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"关于克丽斯腾·莱特的计划，你了解吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我完全不了解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这么说或许有些不太可信，但事实上就是如此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在莱茵生命中，我恐怕是最不合群的那一个......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调查员","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"那克丽斯腾现在的下落呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很抱歉，我也不了解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只知道，她是一个理想主义者。她有一个宏伟的目标。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她邀请我加入莱茵时，我在她身上看到了与我相同的、理想主义者的“闪电”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调查员","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"闪电？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"在特里蒙的方向，天空忽然显现异象。\n一束光柱刺破了天穹，那片蔚蓝背后的真相，在此刻倾泻而出。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调查员","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"那......那个是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调查员","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"特里蒙的天空......发生什么了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调查员","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"这......这该不会就是克丽斯腾的“宏大目标”吧？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调查员","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"弗兰克斯女士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调查员","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"弗兰克斯女士？你......你哭了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这就是天空的真相吗......太美了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很抱歉，我没能抑制住我的眼泪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不愧是克丽斯腾......她做到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调查员","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"弗兰克斯女士，你刚刚还说过，你不清楚克丽斯腾的计划。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我确实不清楚，但这很像是她会做的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且......我切实感受到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调查员","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"感受到？感受到什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“递质”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可以感应到“递质”......它们来到了天空的另一面——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"星河丝毫不掩饰它的冲动，奔涌进我的脑海......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调查员","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调查员","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"你是说，“递质”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调查员","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"据我所知，这好像是359号基地实验的产物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调查员","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"我确实有些好奇......你曾经与这种造物密切接触，那么这种接触对你造成了什么负面影响吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是想说后遗症？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调查员","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"可以这么理解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"直到目前为止，还没有什么特别剧烈的异常症状。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"硬要说的话，可能就是做梦越来越频繁了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"甚至有的时候明明没有入睡......也会在恍然间感觉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调查员","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"感觉什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调查员","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"弗兰克斯女士。弗兰克斯女士？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"噢......不好意思，那种感觉又来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......感觉自己仿佛置身一处了无人烟、干旱炎热的荒野。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_desert_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"热......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好热......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"菜菜......你走慢一点......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菜菜","speakerId":"avg_npc_004","isRemote":false,"text":"多萝西，我到站啦。这里就是我的家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？这里......可是这里这么热......一副毫无生机的样子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那片麦田呢？那幢崭新、坚固的砖瓦房......还有那位一直在麦田里等待你的朋友呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菜菜","speakerId":"avg_npc_004","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......我的朋友，就在咱们边上啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咱们边上？啊......你的朋友不会是这个破破烂烂的稻草人吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菜菜","speakerId":"avg_npc_004","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，嘿嘿，太久没见到他了，没想到他变了这么多......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菜菜","speakerId":"avg_npc_004","isRemote":false,"text":"还有我的家......变化也好大呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"菜菜......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要不你继续跟我走吧！咱们一直一起走......你也可以来我家住！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菜菜","speakerId":"avg_npc_004","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菜菜","speakerId":"avg_npc_004","isRemote":false,"text":"多萝西，你已经陪我们走了很远了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菜菜","speakerId":"avg_npc_004","isRemote":false,"text":"格罗斯，“阿斯兰”先生，还有我......我们都很感激你陪伴我们走过了这一段旅程。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菜菜","speakerId":"avg_npc_004","isRemote":false,"text":"现在，是该告别的时候啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可、可是，我还是很担心......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菜菜","speakerId":"avg_npc_004","isRemote":false,"text":"好啦，多萝西。我已经决定要留下了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菜菜","speakerId":"avg_npc_004","isRemote":false,"text":"就算变化再大......这里也是我的家呀。我的朋友......他也一直在这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菜菜","speakerId":"avg_npc_004","isRemote":false,"text":"我要陪着他，一起重建我们的家。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"吹来一阵风，稻草人摇摇晃晃。\n多萝西向她的最后一位朋友告别。\n黄沙漫漫，自己记忆中的那间银色的房子，到底在何方呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g1_outdoorbase"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调查员","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"克丽斯腾，简直是个疯子啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调查员","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"莱茵生命到底都聚集了些什么怪物......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"克丽斯腾......这就是她想找到的，关于“家园”的答案吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"下次再见到总辖，我一定会当面祝贺她实验成功的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有帕尔维斯......看来他修改了我的成果啊。嗯，很有意思的想法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是“递质”终究只是“递质”，如果没有用来反哺生命，它的存在又有什么意义？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等......我突然想到一种可能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"星荚之外，生命无法存活，但“递质”或许不同。这意味着——“递质”能替代人类走进更恶劣的环境中，无论是天灾深处，还是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太好了，先生，请给我一点时间，我要把这一幕好好地印在自己的脑子里，我要把这一瞬间所有的想法都记下来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的实验还有许多许多改进的空间，递质还有无穷的可能性，我想要的平等，我想要的未来，还有我渴望的......家园......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调查员","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"你一直说的“家园”到底是什么样子？该不会是在......天上？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"家园？\n我所说的家园......未来的风景......\n到底是什么样子？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g5_laboratory"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是我的家吗？这个银色的房子......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"母亲的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"多萝西，这里......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是妈妈的声音......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"妈妈......你在哪？我怎么找不到你......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"母亲的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"多萝西，这里......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_light"},{"type":"narration","text":"多萝西，这里不应该是你未来的风景......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g2_edgeofbase"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"未来的风景......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"到底应该在何处呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调查员","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"弗兰克斯女士，请停止你的自言自语。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调查员","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"回答我的问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，调查员先生。我不过是简单复述一下我的灵感。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我所说的“家园”，并非你所想的那样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我追求的，是一种更为平等的理想社会。它可能就在我们的脚下，也可能在克丽斯腾所追求的更远的远方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在想想，克丽斯腾、帕尔维斯、斐尔迪南......还有我，我们这些莱茵生命的科学家，我们之间并不存在趋同的目标。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果说存在什么共性，可能就在于......我在他们每一个人身上都见过这道“闪电”般炽烈的光芒吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调查员","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"多萝西注意到，调查员按下了录音笔的暂停键。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调查员","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"弗兰克斯女士，我想我有必要提醒你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调查员","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"假如你追求理想的方式也是与克丽斯腾、斐尔迪南等人相似的——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调查员","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"刚才你所说的这些内容，或许对你很不利。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"不知从何处，吹来一阵风。\n......是荒野的滋味。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奥提先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调查员","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥提","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"你......你怎么知道我的名字？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不妨先听听我的故事吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我曾帮助过一位拓荒者，她叫琳达。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在年轻时因为矿石病，她被迫和家人们分离，流落荒野。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对琳达来说，孩提时与家人们在乡野中的时光，是她最珍贵的回忆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"秋天到来时，那一片金黄的麦田......麦田里随风摇晃的稻草人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有那个总跟在她身后，在麦田里无休止地奔跑的弟弟......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥提","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥提","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"你......认识我的姐姐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥提","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"她、她现在怎么样了？......她过得好不好？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"果然是你啊。琳达曾给我看过和家人们的合影......看到你的第一眼，我就在猜你是她的弟弟了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她成婚了，还邀请我参加了她的婚礼。荒野中的仪式很简单，但她嫁给了一个可靠的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在他们有了孩子。那小孩非常可爱，天天缠着他妈妈，要听“稻草人”的故事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在琳达口中，弟弟一直是她的骄傲......她很笃定，出类拔萃又有责任心的奥提，会替她好好陪伴家人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥提","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥提","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"很抱歉......我突然不知道该说些什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥提","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"弗兰克斯女士，我该如何向你表达感谢呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不必如此，奥提先生。我讲这个故事，并非为了向你讨取回报。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"帮助拓荒者......我自认为是我的天职。在接下来的时间里，我也会以这种方式，继续追求我的理想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，我问心无愧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奥提先生，我说的一切都请如实记录。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唯有人与人之间的爱与善意，不该被交易。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥提","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥提","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白了，弗兰克斯女士。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"录音笔再次开启。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g11_monitoringroom"},{"type":"narration","text":"一天后"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你来了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"神秘访客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"神秘访客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你猜到我会来？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是非常优秀的合作者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道，如果你想要承担更多的责任，就一定会来找我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在看来，你果然又有所成长了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"确实如你所料，“递质”会被利用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我应该感谢你提供的线索。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我与政府达成了合作，此行前来，正是为了回收“递质”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这样啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"亲爱的医生，我们来“交易”吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想要什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"克丽斯腾现在在哪里？莱茵生命又会走向哪里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至少在很长一段时间内，无论是对莱茵生命内部人员来说，还是其他人，这个答案都是“不知道”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"问这些事情，你有什么计划？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想留在莱茵生命，继续我的研究。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然，如果能去更多的地方，结识其他志同道合的人，让我的研究得以造福更多人，那就更好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我记得，你好像在和一家名为罗德岛的公司合作吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不知你和......罗德岛，愿不愿意成为我的合作者呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"科学理应真切地为每个人服务——我知道的，奥利维亚，这是我们共同的梦想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果有你的协助，让我的成果掌握在正确的人手中——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我相信我们的梦想，一定会在未来实现。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
